      "Description": "Ordinary merges can still land while master Merge gate (task check) is red. This activation records Prefer-A Bound so a later product PR can refuse those merges and keep only a narrow maintainer hotfix cited-skip escape.",
      "Origin": "Ingested from https://github.com/deftai/directive/issues/6071",
      "Overview": "Ordinary merges can still land while master Merge gate (task check) is red. This activation records Prefer-A Bound so a later product PR can refuse those merges and keep only a narrow maintainer hotfix cited-skip escape.",
