      "Acceptance": "Bound remedy limbs are the acceptance set; product PR must satisfy each limb under declared file_scope.",
      "AcceptanceJustification": "Prefer-A Bound ships one acceptance item per locked limb; clause count follows the Bound comment and may exceed five."
    },
